&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcsbdDN4UoaUL3xrh3WcSINOnde&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SmHBdHaliojykyxks7ecwSS8n5d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong understanding of large-scale data systems, cloud infrastructure, and data pipelines.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VPzJdsNaRouwcgxLJ0HcwYNZnOT&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience in establishing strong software development processes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JqQqdqs8Go4Goox6jbqcVmYynDf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vu5Kdz7xBoq4foxaHSrc57eBnee&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RjuEd6Eexo0OZdxHGBhc2rmFngg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with autonomous-driving data platforms, machine learning infrastructure, or large-scale training-data systems.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TnW3dDckPoQ8FHxdvbqcK5KAn4c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
