&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation packages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;High-quality individual and family medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
