&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Employer-paid group term life insurance and the option to elect voluntary life insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
